{"title": "Gremishka Tail", "pageid": 9223, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gremishka_Tail", "categories": ["Alchemical ingredients", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gremishka_Tail_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Gremishka_Tail_Icon.png/300px-Gremishka_Tail_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/95/Gremishka_Tail_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Gremishka Tail image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Gremishka_Tail_Icon.png/300px-Gremishka_Tail_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Gremishka_Tail_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Gremsihka Tail</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Ingredient</a>. Combine 3 of these to extract their <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail\" title=\"Essence of Gremishka Tail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png/30px-Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png/40px-Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Gremishka_Tail\" title=\"Essence of Gremishka Tail\">Essence of Gremishka Tail</a>, which is used to make <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wizardsbane_Oil\" title=\"Wizardsbane Oil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/GRN_Holy_Water_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wizardsbane_Oil\" title=\"Wizardsbane Oil\">Wizardsbane Oil</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>When a feckless spellcaster attempts to create life and bungles it, the result is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gremishka\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"gremishka\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gremishka\">gremishka</a></span>. Spiteful and malformed, gremishkas hold a particular loathing for practitioners of the arcane arts, a dark reflection of typical parental love.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/38px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/50px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alchemical Ingredients\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=